  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your sense of self is so powerful that spirits struggle to pull you under their influence.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Bind spirit class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you make a poor pact with a spirit, you do not suffer the spirit’s personality influence unless you fail your binding check by 5 or more.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> When you fail a binding check, you suffer the spirit’s personality influence for the pact’s duration.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/pact-magic-feats#toc68\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
